// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// NOVA GENESIS — Language layer (Español ⇄ English)
// Spanish is the source language. Every string (UI text and site data)
// is looked up by its Spanish original in EN below.
//   tr('Texto')               → translated string (or the original in ES)
//   tf('Hola {n}', {n:'x'})   → translated template with {placeholders}
//   translateStatic(root)     → translates static HTML text nodes/attributes
// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
